 sdk/include/reactos/mc/ntiologc.mc    | 144 +++++++++++-
 sdk/include/reactos/mc/pciclass.mc    | 303 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 652 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

