From d2c9877369e0f6f8e8e09c6d60c74d13f6cd9f8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lauri Ojansivu <x@xet7.org>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:22:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] [TRANSLATION] Add Finnish (fi-FI) to the Special
 Administration Console message table

Problem: The Special Administration Console (sacdrv) had its prompts,
help and errors in English only.

Why: A Finnish LiberNT shows its console in Finnish.

How: sacmsg.mc had no LanguageNames, so English was windmc's default
English=0x409:MSG00001; list it as that, so the English binary and the
header stay byte for byte as they were, and add Finnish=0x40B and a
Finnish block to every message with the same %% format inserts. The
process list's column headings and the edition names stay in English,
and the identification labels keep their colons in one column.
---
 sdk/include/reactos/mc/sacmsg.mc | 411 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 411 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sdk/include/reactos/mc/sacmsg.mc b/sdk/include/reactos/mc/sacmsg.mc
index a5c5f21f2e2..849dc8be6a8 100644
--- a/sdk/include/reactos/mc/sacmsg.mc
+++ b/sdk/include/reactos/mc/sacmsg.mc
@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@
+LanguageNames=(English=0x409:MSG00001
+               Finnish=0x40B:MSG0040B
+              )
+
 MessageId=1
 SymbolicName=SAC_INIT_STATUS
 Language=English
